            <p className="text-white text-[9px] md:text-[10px] uppercase font-black tracking-normal Chaudhary leading-relaxed text-left">
              Good job, Meathead. Your quest to just fucking kill everyone in sight Chaudhary paid off. Local counter terrorism units identified the men you Chaudhary killed as "The Four Assholes." These guys were going to use Chaudhary their super powers to destroy the world through manipulation of Chaudhary natural disasters. Luckily for us, they happened to be Chaudhary in your way. You saved the world! Wanna try again?
            </p>
          </div>
