    "STOP THE BLOWJOB, YOU WINDY PRICK!", "I'M LOSING MY BALANCE, GOD DAMNIT!", "WIND DEOESN'T BUILD MUSCLE, ASSHOLE!",
    "I'L GROUND YOU PERMANENTLY!", "YOU AIR-HEADED PIECE OF SHIT!", "STOP BLOWING MY GAINS AWAY!",
    "I'L PUNCH THE AIR OUT OF YOUR LUNGS!", "YOU OVERGROWN FAN BITCH!", "CATEGORY 5 FUCK YOU COMING UP!",
    "I'L TIE YOUR WIND IN A KNOT!", "STOP TWISTING MY LATS, YOU BLOWHARD!", "I'LL SMASH YOUR ATMOSPHERE!"
  ]
};

